{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6ef273508c3d31d7c2ece4a026b5a72f58c62c6a6d2a985b12e87503b0c8652a", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日だ。\n美也は『ネコ』の衣装で撮影をする）", "zh": "（今天是cosplay写真企划的拍摄日。\n美也要穿‘猫咪’的服装拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "ac55d0f619b57fe4e2455e4a7cd4d4f1cbcd74d1bc9eb2ae7183856551d8040d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nにゃーん、にゃん、にゃあーん。にゃん、にゃおーん？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n喵～，喵，喵——。喵，喵呜～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "5d3c4b5c49869a12e8617841932ecc1fb9d60e15b830bb05b12fea852cf11d5c", "ja": "むふふ～。\n今、私はなんと言ったでしょう～？", "zh": "呵呵呵～。\n您猜我刚才说了什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1003_p", "source_sha256": "96d8bd162bf3a421f74930084f2d5ea6df0cc27df5a1699e90494257b8913c16", "ja": "えっ！？\nあいにくネコ語は分からなくて……。", "zh": "啊！？真不巧，我听不懂猫语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "6f6415b37613bf4256825a34bad524e1754f8b646d8a46192d9a39f85c556f91", "ja": "そうですか～……むーん。\n一生懸命練習したのですが、残念です～。", "zh": "这样啊～……唔。\n我可是努力练习了好久，真遗憾～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1005_p", "source_sha256": "01e8fb25162df34ce85b825edbe8711dc656ee7e94b1ec25187be9ef89a75e0e", "ja": "ごめん。でも、その衣装なのもあって……\nすごくネコっぽくていい感じだと思ったよ。", "zh": "抱歉。不过，加上那套服装，看起来特别像猫，我觉得感觉很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "84efdfea29af3ca933c6949cb13efef20cea492c4117c59315cda0ba9f0ab475", "ja": "あっ……むふふ。それなら良かったです～。\n環ちゃんにも感謝ですな～。", "zh": "啊……呜呼呼。那就太好了～  \n也要感谢环环呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d3e018c1e2a6a4c7851a7a79216e4ce00305f7cc9ae90a1327e00cd65ecfa101", "ja": "環に？", "zh": "给环？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "faeb21e6a7575cacfe6d87b45e8a9202e5396e44cc8148ca5b889c621be0fe56", "ja": "はい～。環ちゃんと一緒に研究したんです～。\nこぶんちゃんや、街のネコさんのこと。", "zh": "是的～我和小环一起研究过哦～\n研究的是小伙伴，还有街上的猫咪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "086a729cbf28e5a5a1c7f12448f63ca5ce6b00b9f89808096458014c4b02b698", "ja": "不思議ですな～。\n言葉やしぐさは、私たちと全然違うのに……。", "zh": "真不可思议呀～  \n明明语言和动作都和我们完全不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "4aa678d098e122c9ce8ab91c416b8a224e8174d21e3fb9fec0cfc640ac039590", "ja": "見ていると、なんとなく何を考えているのか\nわかるようになってくるんです～。", "zh": "看着看着，就渐渐能明白它在想什么了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1011_p", "source_sha256": "abe34fbc167563bad75d7cbaf78c4821fa0931b92a74c467ac9e4afccf224f79", "ja": "へえ、そうなんだ……あれ？\nってことは、さっきのネコ語って……。", "zh": "诶，是这样啊……咦？\n也就是说，刚才的猫语其实是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "cdd981e46fcd12d4b3106d96bbe39ae7d26a1d2548677f76bac1a8b6648e76f1", "ja": "もちろん、本当のネコ語ではありませんよ～。\nでも{$P$}さんが相手なら……。", "zh": "当然不是真正的猫咪语言啦～。\n不过如果是面对{$P$}先生的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "0ede006cd4a4ce3b3a5b68fefdd2fe89fabf11d32f2243c7ab6dc421522629a0", "ja": "私が猫になっても、何を言っているか\nちゃんと伝わるような気がしたんです～。", "zh": "就算我变成猫，我也觉得说的话能好好传达给您听呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f06fad33db3bd8ce7235df899e061f5a99840fab749f04892ce4b08737549374", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。理解できるように努力するよ。\nそれで、美也はネコ語で何を伝えたかったんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。我会努力理解的。\n那么，美也想用猫语传达什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0533_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "598c86aab6d1e67c75300583dd8e5fce07de847b7cf54af36020b6a6c44c6a22", "ja": "ふふっ、それはナイショです～。\nでも……お返事はちゃ～んと、いただけましたよ～♪", "zh": "呵呵，那可是秘密哦～  \n不过……我已经好好收到回复了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
